OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo continues to bring
OL,6,Fstrong winds on Sunday, with showers
OL,7,Fand longer spells of rain affecting
OL,8,FScotland and Northern Ireland.
OL,9,FElsewhere, there will be some
OL,10,Fsunshine, although scattered showers
OL,11,Fdevelop in the west and north.
OL,12,FTemperatures near average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers and strong winds in
OL,15,Fthe north ease overnight, with many
OL,16,Fplaces dry. Rain and strengthening
OL,17,Fwinds reach the southwest later.
OL,18,FChilly for some, with patchy frost
OL,19,Fpossible further north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
