OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FRain sweeps northeast across
OL,6,Fthe UK, with strengthening winds
OL,7,Fbringing gales in the north later.
OL,8,FDespite the wet weather, temperatures
OL,9,Fwill be widely above average, feeling
OL,10,Fmild for late October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
